<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Metair still in talks, warns holders.</title>
<headline>Metair still in talks, warns holders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metair Investments Ltd said on Wednesday it was still in talks which could have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to continue exercising caution in their share dealings pending a further announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
